[12V POWER SUPPLY]
  (+)-------------------------------------> To LED Strip 12V Pad
  (-)---+---------------------------------> Main Ground Rail
        |
        +--- ESP32 GND Pin
        |
        +--- MOSFET 1 Source (Right Leg) -> Gate (Left) to ESP32 Pin 4
        |      L--> Drain (Middle Leg) ---> To LED Strip R Pad (Red)
        |
        +--- MOSFET 2 Source (Right Leg) -> Gate (Left) to ESP32 Pin 5
        |      L--> Drain (Middle Leg) ---> To LED Strip G Pad (Green)
        |
        +--- MOSFET 3 Source (Right Leg) -> Gate (Left) to ESP32 Pin 18
               L--> Drain (Middle Leg) ---> To LED Strip B Pad (Blue)